    <string name="home_label_select_folder">Chagua mpira ambacho unapakua muziki yango. Katika Android moja, system inabock chaguo katikati ya media folders (Music, Downloads, etc.) — kipato kidogo kama Music/Albums na chagua huyo sasa. Audio katikati ya folders mbalimbali anapakua miziki wako via music-access permission; unaweza kutumia kifuta files kwa tag-burning feature.</string>
