    <string name="empty_library_title">Hata muziki kati</string>
    <string name="empty_library_subtitle">OfflinePlaya inakwenda faili ya audio ambayo iko na wewe katikati — huna streaming. Hapa ni njia ya kutambua muziki yako:</string>
    <string name="empty_library_step1_title">1 · Ongeza faili katika kompyuta</string>
    <string name="empty_library_step1_body">Kupiga au kudownload tracks (MP3, FLAC, M4A, OGG…) nje ya PC au Mac, au kopieka wakati wa CD au koleksha zingine.</string>
    <string name="empty_library_step2_title">2 · Kopieka hadi phone</string>
    <string name="empty_library_step2_body">Tafuta telefonu yako kwa USB na tuka faili hadhi katika mtafutaji ya Downloads au Music. Kama microSD card, download kutoka cloud, au transfer via Bluetooth inatokea pia — hata kuna wakati bila kuweka faili katikani storage ya device yako.</string>
    <string name="empty_library_step3_title">3 · Tumike OfflinePlaya</string>
    <string name="empty_library_step3_body">Tuongeza app (tuka na Recents) na tukifanye sikuomba tena. It rescans kwa makosa mengine, hata wakati bila kuweka faili katikani storage ya device yako.</string>
    <string name="empty_library_permission_note">Music in Downloads and Music itakuwepo kama unatumia permissio kutafuta music. Kupumzika folder mingine, tukifanye Settings → Library na ongeza hapa.</string>
    <string name="empty_library_open_settings">Open Settings</string>
    <string name="empty_library_pick_folder">Chagua kikubwa ya muziki</string>
    <string name="empty_library_scan_device">Tafuta muziki katika wakati huu wa mfumo</string>
    <string name="permission_required_title">Ili kutumia muziki inahitajika</string>
    <string name="permission_required_body">OfflinePlaya ni player iliyo na ujenge — it plays files audio ambayo zilifungwa kwenye mfumo huo, na hakuna yoyote anapokwenda siku ya kuweka permiision kutumia wakati wa muziki. Tafuta access music iliyotangaza.</string>
    <string name="permission_required_grant">Tafuta access music</string>
    <string name="permission_required_open_settings">Openda matokeo ya aplikasi</string>
    <string name="permission_required_denied_note">Ikiwa huna kazi kutapika tofauti, hakikio inatimiza permissiya iliyotangaza bila — ongeza sehemu yake na matokeo ya aplikasi.</string>
